# Coral Runway (CIPlay vi_coral_runway): quest "Wheels Up" (12 steps)
# The runway zone at -10 0 (3 m); the tower hut x -32..-27.5 z 14..17 with the strip log and radio, the generator at
# -24 10; the mechanic's chest at -40 11; the warthogs round 20 2; the lagoon jetty zone at 20 25, the fuel log at
# 23 22.5, the fuel drum at 25 24; the pump at 14.5 11; the hangar locker inside the hangar store x -46..-40 z 14..18.5.
# offset: set in phase 2.
island Coral Runway
offset -0.4637 -0.9763
expect step 0
expect title Wheels Up
wait 5
expect animals Warthog 4
expect hidden runwaylights
expect hidden hangarlocker
zone runway
expect step 1
read Strip log
expect step 2
kill Warthog
expect step 3
use runwaygen
expect hidden runwaylights
open Mechanic's chest
wait 3
expect story raft-Tangaroa_GeneratorPart 1
expect step 4
use runwaygen
expect story runwaylit 1
expect shown runwaylights
expect step 5
use towerradio
expect story radiocall 1
expect step 6
zone lagoon_jetty
expect step 7
read Fuel log
expect step 8
use fuelpump
expect hidden hangarlocker
open Fuel drum
wait 3
expect story raft-Vasagatan_GasTank 1
expect step 9
use fuelpump
expect story fuelpumped 1
expect shown hangarlocker
expect step 10
open Hangar locker
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_HeadLight 1
expect done
